// Real readings from the start of five of the owner's rides on "KevinJK"
// (JK-BD6A20S6P, 20S NMC), taken from the backup of 2026-09-08. Generated, not
// written by hand: do not edit the numbers.
//
// Each ride is the first six minutes after it was opened by hand. [readings]
// holds (milliseconds from the start, current in amps) for every reading the
// app stored, discharge negative, at the 2 to 3 a second the pack sends and
// with the link's real gaps left in. [fixes] holds (milliseconds, speed in
// km/h) for every GPS point the ride stored, which the recorder keeps about
// every five seconds. Timestamps are whole seconds, as the database stores
// them, so several readings share one.
//
// They exist to replay what the auto-start sees on a real ride rather than on
// a made-up one: a made-up ride draws a steady 20 A, and on that every version
// of the detector works.

